  "description": {
    "en": "A self-contained agent preset for biomedical research: 603 skills in 34 functional categories (genomics, multi-omics, single-cell, proteomics, metabolomics, epigenomics, spatial omics, structural biology, drug discovery, clinical imaging, research methods), each category toggleable from a grouped settings page, plus a bundled 51-tool public-data MCP server and a per-session subagent cap.",
